摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Background — upload custom photo/GIF backgrounds and tune glassmorphism, typography, colors, and motion.","id":"gh:1338185861","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-prism-plugin","slug":"mantonlove/dsh-prism-plugin","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","glassmorphism","plugin","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Background — upload custom photo/GIF backgrounds and tune glassmorphism, typography, colors, and"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ground — upload custom photo/GIF backgrounds and tune glassmorphism, typography, colors, and motion."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Background — Custom Background Images & Glassmorphism"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DSH Background** lets you upload your own photos or animated GIFs as the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"background, then tune glassmorphism, opacity, typography, colors, and motion. Version 2 is adapted t"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"o the DSH `0.2.2-rc.1` settings and theme APIs and ships prebuilt in `lib/`; installing the plugin d"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"oes not require a build step."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness `0.2.2-rc.1` or later in the `0.2.x` series."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### Desktop app"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Add plugin** and enter:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"For local development, use `link:/absolute/path/to/dsh-prism-plugin` instead. Linked builds can be h"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ot-applied; refresh the Web GUI if necessary."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Web profile CLI"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` and refresh the page. Open **设置 → 通用设置 → 外观 → DSH Background** to use the theme st"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"udio. The master switch is built into the DSH Background panel."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Uninstall:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What’s new in v2"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Six visual presets:** Night, Aurora, Crystal, Dune, Rose, and Forest apply a complete, coordinat"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ed appearance recipe.\n- **Portable custom themes:** save up to 24 named looks, apply or delete them,"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" and exchange versioned JSON theme files. Import validates every value before applying it; duplicate"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" names receive numeric suffixes instead of overwriting an existing look.\n- **Task-oriented studio:**"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" Themes, Glass, Backdrop, and Type tabs replace the old accordion and the retired `settings.plugin.i"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"tem` master card.\n- **Clearer controls:** accessible switches and buttons, selected/focus/disabled s"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"tates, keyboard-operated sliders, double-click slider reset, and section-level zone reset.\n- **Live "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"miniature preview:** inspect the active palette and material before changing the main interface."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Theme features"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Clear, frosted, and velvet materials; blur and global frost; six independent zone opacities for th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e base, sidebar, cards, inputs, overlays, and bubbles.\n- Hex and color-picker controls for the accen"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"t, backdrop, and light/dark text colors.\n- **Custom background images:** upload your own photos or a"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"nimated GIFs into separate light/dark playlists, with fixed/loop playback and manage mode.\n- Spring-"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"damped adjustments, font scale and family, and animated aurora.\n- A master switch that restores the "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"stock interface, persistent `localStorage` settings, cross-tab synchronization, and reduced-motion s"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"upport.\n- Theme exports contain appearance settings only. Wallpaper images, wallpaper playlists, and"},{"id":"p18s8","text":" the master-switch state are never included."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Examples of the glass theme applied to the workspace, welcome surface, and composer:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Effect 1 | Effect 2 | Effect 3 |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22+ and pnpm 11."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"`pnpm bundle` builds the host modules, browser bundle, CSS modules, and declarations into `lib/`. Th"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e DSH client packages and React remain external and are supplied by the host Web GUI. Prebuilt relea"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"se files are committed so source installs work without developer tooling."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"简体中文 · License"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
